      specsOrStack: "The public stack includes the browser Studio, AIUI Skills Library, AIUI Code, Interactive Inview, Rokid AI Glasses, Hi Rokid App, Agent Store, and the upload and permission flow. Rokid says the tools can reduce latency, memory use, and power consumption; developer and Agent Store counts are company disclosures. The underlying SDK schema, model version, runtime, device matrix, network dependency, offline behaviour, review SLA, and API pricing are source not stated.",
